  "title": "THE EXTRACTED 25 GEV/C PROTON BEAM FOR THE CERN NEUTRINO EXPERIMENT",
  "publication_date": "1963-09-17",
  "language": "English",
  "abstract": "The 25 GeV/c proton becam is extracted from the CERN proton synchrotron within a time-interval of 2.1 µs. For the production of a high flux of pions and kaons the beam is then guided towards an external target and in the target focused to approx. 1mm2 cross section. Results of preliminary beam studies are disucssed and the apparatus used described.",
